  ('L3 — Advanced', 'Process and Procedures', 'Process Flowcharts & Process Mapping - The Beginner''s Guide', 'Free - Udemy', 'optional', 3.5, 'Free - Udemy', 'Builds a clear, swimlane-style process flowchart for a support workflow using a free flowcharting tool (Draw.io), so process gaps are visible to non-technical stakeholders.', 'senior', 'https://skedulo.udemy.com/course/process-mapping-process-flowcharts/', 60),
